        "body": "## Changes\n- Built with CDK from cashubtc/cdk@v0.17.0-rc.0\n\n## Installation\nAdd cdk-swift to your Swift Package Manager dependencies:\n```swift\n.package(url: \"https://github.com/cashubtc/cdk-swift\", from: \"0.17.0-rc.0\")\n```\n",
